# Set this to enable the real Claude-powered pipeline. When unset, /api/plan
# returns a deterministic mock so the full flow still works end-to-end.
#
# IMPORTANT: unset is a DEVELOPMENT configuration. With no key the pipeline
# returns a complete, real-looking plan whose findings are invented, marked
# only by `mode: "mock"`. Clients must branch on that field; the mobile app
# does. Never deploy without this set.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional shared secret for /api/plan. When set, requests must carry it as
# `x-pore-key` and the mobile app must send the same value. When unset, no
# check runs, so local development needs no configuration.
#
# This is friction, not authentication: the mobile app ships its copy inside
# the JS bundle, so anyone with the binary can read it. It stops automated
# scanning for unprotected LLM proxies, which is what a public endpoint like
# this actually gets hit by.
PLAN_API_KEY=
